ing\">ongoing</a>; keeping along step by step.", "parsedExamples": [{"example": "a <b>running</b> commentary, a <b>running</b> explanation, my <b>running</b> theory"}], "examples": ["a <b>running</b> commentary, a <b>running</b> explanation, my <b>running</b> theory"]}, {"definition": "Having a continuous design or pattern.", "parsedExamples": [{"example": "<b>running</b> bond<span typeof=\"mw:Entity\">;</span> <b>running</b> ornament"}], "examples": ["<b>running</b> bond<span typeof=\"mw:Entity\">;</span> <b>running</b> ornament"]}, {"definition": "<a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/consecutive\" title=\"consecutive\">Consecutive</a> .", "parsedExamples": [{"example": "He won the title for three <b>running</b> years."}], "examples": ["He won the title for three <b>running</b> years."]}, {"definition": "<span class=\"usage-label-sense\" about=\"#mwt23\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\"></span> Extending by a slender climbing or trailing stem.", "parsedExamples": [{"example": "a <b>running</b> vine"}], "examples": ["a <b>running</b> vine"]}, {"definition": "<span class=\"usage-label-sense\" about=\"#mwt25\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\"></span> Discharging <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/pus\" title=\"pus\">pus</a>.", "parsedExamples": [{"example": "a <b>running</b> sore"}], "examples": ["a <b>running</b> sore"]}, {"definition": "<span class=\"usage-label-sense\" about=\"#mwt27\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\"></span> <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/discharge\" title=\"discharge\">Discharging</a> <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/snot\" title=\"snot\">snot</a> or <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/mucus\" title=\"mucus\">mucus</a>.", "parsedExamples": [{"example": "a <b>running</b> nose"}], "examples": ["a <b>running</b> nose"]}]}, {"partOfSpeech": "Adverb", "language": "English", "definitions": [{"definition": "<span class=\"usage-label-sense\" about=\"#mwt87\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\"></span> <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/consecutively\" title=\"consecutivel